S625 UNIT-DISTANCE TOURNAMENT HAMILTONIAN PATH SCOUT
====================================================

Mapping rules:
- unit-flip: start with the transitive base order and flip exactly unit pairs.
- nonunit-flip: start with the transitive base order and flip nonunit pairs.
- snake-base variant: choose the base order from a unit Hamiltonian path when one exists.

